    {
      "segment_id": "00-03:b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPU Setup & Cloud",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "6256a38eeaa83aa7ea2cec23f437ecc68c8994ee84d37bc2251d610d859ec4c2",
      "target": "第 1-3 阶段的大多数课程都可以在 CPU 上顺利运行。但一旦在第 4+ 阶段开始训练卷积神经网络（CNN）、Transformer 或大语言模型（LLM），就需要 GPU 加速。在 CPU 上需要 8 hours（小时）的训练，在 GPU 上只需 10 minutes（分钟）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-03:b0014",
      "kind": "separator",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPU Setup & Cloud",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 7,
      "source_sha256": "01ba4719c80b6fe911b091a7c05124b64eeece964e09c058ef8f9805daca546b",
      "target": "\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-03:b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "heading_path": [
        "# GPU Setup & Cloud",
        "## The Problem"
      ],
      "ordinal": 8,
      "source_sha256": "92c9ef8644c84864e62c5101b9f8cc3ed4802ea97eeb1b529772cbcbafa3a98f",
      "target": "你有三种选择：本地 GPU、云端 GPU，或 Google Colab（免费）。\n"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "00-03:b0016",
      "kind": "separator",
